(4582370, 661104, 34938, '<td valign="top">Tim, if it''s not cigars, it''s sugar that you stuff into your mouth! :)<br/> <br/>I am sitting in Manila airport on transit back home after a great missions trip, and saw this and couldn''t resist on commenting!<br/> <br/>Lighting and that stunned look on your face are great...mine is bombing, I think mine is too serious...good luck, we might see your mugshot on the front page twice - now that would be something never done before!</td>', 'Tim, if it''s not cigars, it''s sugar that you stuff into your mouth! :) I am sitting in Manila airport on transit back home after a great missions trip, and saw this and couldn''t resist on commenting! Lighting and that stunned look on your face are great...mine is bombing, I think mine is too serious...good luck, we might see your mugshot on the front page twice - now that would be something never done before!', '2008-03-24 01:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
