(4582597, 661426, 53147, '<td valign="top">Now this looks like it could actually be used as an advertisemnt. The idea is funny, but not laugh out loud funny. Yet it is visually appealing to me. The browns work well with the yellows. I am going to have to make sure Aimee sees this so that she can actually do this next week when our kids have hot chocolate again. They will surely get a kick out of it. TY!</td>', 'Now this looks like it could actually be used as an advertisemnt. The idea is funny, but not laugh out loud funny. Yet it is visually appealing to me. The browns work well with the yellows. I am going to have to make sure Aimee sees this so that she can actually do this next week when our kids have hot chocolate again. They will surely get a kick out of it. TY!', '2008-03-24 05:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
