(4582980, 661166, 65234, '<td valign="top">Film Noire Peep.  The little face pointed right at us is perfect.  Nice composition, actually, and it''s almost poignant ... but it''s a Peep so I''m still inclined to giggle.</td>', 'Film Noire Peep.  The little face pointed right at us is perfect.  Nice composition, actually, and it''s almost poignant ... but it''s a Peep so I''m still inclined to giggle.', '2008-03-24 09:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4582981, 661425, 65234, '<td valign="top">Clever way to get a sunset in!  Hope the Peep enjoyed his ride.</td>', 'Clever way to get a sunset in!  Hope the Peep enjoyed his ride.', '2008-03-24 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4582986, 661504, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe the dog stopped to howl!  Mine would''ve scarfed those little bunnies down in a heartbeat.  Think I would like a little more or a little less DOF so the dog was either clear or really blurry.  I can''t quite tell if his current blur is on purpose.</td>', 'I can''t believe the dog stopped to howl!  Mine would''ve scarfed those little bunnies down in a heartbeat.  Think I would like a little more or a little less DOF so the dog was either clear or really blurry.  I can''t quite tell if his current blur is on purpose.', '2008-03-24 09:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4582989, 661185, 65234, '<td valign="top">Overkill on the equipment, doncha'' think?  Some people will use any excuse to play with power tools!</td>', 'Overkill on the equipment, doncha'' think?  Some people will use any excuse to play with power tools!', '2008-03-24 09:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
