(4584034, 661189, 65234, '<td valign="top">My, but they''re lovely :-)  They add such a garish ... er, bright ... touch to the beach.  Don''t let them stay in the sun too long, though; it''s VERY bad for them.</td>', 'My, but they''re lovely :-)  They add such a garish ... er, bright ... touch to the beach.  Don''t let them stay in the sun too long, though; it''s VERY bad for them.', '2008-03-24 19:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
