(4584079, 661416, 19799, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective colouring. Would have liked to see less of the bird blocked by the cage! BTW...how in the heck did you get your cat to be such a fabulous participant?</td>', 'Great use of selective colouring. Would have liked to see less of the bird blocked by the cage! BTW...how in the heck did you get your cat to be such a fabulous participant?', '2008-03-24 19:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4584085, 661291, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks a bit like he''s wearing a lab coat, and I''m really pretty sure swashbuckling types don''t wear glasses.  However, he must be pretty clever to triumph over prey which is so much bigger than he is.  (I would say outweighs him, but that may not be true.)  Then again, the Peep suicidally chose a habitat without cover of any kind, so maybe he wanted the nerd with the sword to kill him.</td>', 'He looks a bit like he''s wearing a lab coat, and I''m really pretty sure swashbuckling types don''t wear glasses.  However, he must be pretty clever to triumph over prey which is so much bigger than he is.  (I would say outweighs him, but that may not be true.)  Then again, the Peep suicidally chose a habitat without cover of any kind, so maybe he wanted the nerd with the sword to kill him.', '2008-03-24 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4584087, 661511, 65234, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh, he is about to suffer the Wrath of the Peeps.  This is not going to be pretty, I can tell.</td>', 'Uh-oh, he is about to suffer the Wrath of the Peeps.  This is not going to be pretty, I can tell.', '2008-03-24 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
