(4585688, 661219, 36499, '<td valign="top">this is really good and a very creative entry. love the set up but i do have a few suggestions that might make this better (from my pov of course). first thing your BG needs a good ironing. 2nd I wouldve placed sand down and set the peeps up on it exactly where they are now. placement of the props looks perfect to me. lighting placement is alos perfect as it gives the feeling of true sunlight. thats really the only two suggestions i have. extra points for creativity and orginality!! good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'this is really good and a very creative entry. love the set up but i do have a few suggestions that might make this better (from my pov of course). first thing your BG needs a good ironing. 2nd I wouldve placed sand down and set the peeps up on it exactly where they are now. placement of the props looks perfect to me. lighting placement is alos perfect as it gives the feeling of true sunlight. thats really the only two suggestions i have. extra points for creativity and orginality!! good luck~~Cher~~', '2008-03-25 12:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
