(4591853, 661515, 91954, '<td valign="top">Great -- concept AND execution!!!</td>', 'Great -- concept AND execution!!!', '2008-03-27 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591932, 661505, 16488, '<td valign="top">Creative use of elements to make this scene. Can I say it''s "believable"? Yes, weirdly, I''m sitting in a low balcony seat (just like Lincoln when he was shot...gasp!) looking down on the peeps and their peeps. :) Are those wood tulip cut-outs from the craft shop!? ...and muffin papers, too!? Lighting is what makes this, of course. It''s just how it should be down to the last detail of stepping... Smacks of Scalvert! (Which, if you don''t know and aren''t he himself, is a compliment...I think.) I will curse you with a high vote (as I did another) in the hopes that it plagues your profile page for long to come. ;-&gt;</td>', 'Creative use of elements to make this scene. Can I say it''s "believable"? Yes, weirdly, I''m sitting in a low balcony seat (just like Lincoln when he was shot...gasp!) looking down on the peeps and their peeps. :) Are those wood tulip cut-outs from the craft shop!? ...and muffin papers, too!? Lighting is what makes this, of course. It''s just how it should be down to the last detail of stepping... Smacks of Scalvert! (Which, if you don''t know and aren''t he himself, is a compliment...I think.) I will curse you with a high vote (as I did another) in the hopes that it plagues your profile page for long to come. ;->', '2008-03-27 16:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4591970, 661246, 16488, '<td valign="top">Hello! Peep...peep...peep!<br/>So simple and sweet...selective focus is delicious. Expectation served up well. Humor in its highest sense of subtlety. :)</td>', 'Hello! Peep...peep...peep!So simple and sweet...selective focus is delicious. Expectation served up well. Humor in its highest sense of subtlety. :)', '2008-03-27 17:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
