(4593284, 661184, 17203, '<td valign="top">Aimeethepincushion strikes again! A fabulous idea for the challenge that enabled you to focus on a single Peep without any other distractions (always a good thing). That said, I wish your lighting had been more dramatic. You made this great prop and then just stopped there. A spotlight would have emphasized the "show off" nature of this rare bird, popped the colors and added dimension. The relatively dull lighting here drags my vote all the way down to a 9, but I predict you''ll be cursing this image on your profile page for a looong time. ;-P</td>', 'Aimeethepincushion strikes again! A fabulous idea for the challenge that enabled you to focus on a single Peep without any other distractions (always a good thing). That said, I wish your lighting had been more dramatic. You made this great prop and then just stopped there. A spotlight would have emphasized the "show off" nature of this rare bird, popped the colors and added dimension. The relatively dull lighting here drags my vote all the way down to a 9, but I predict you''ll be cursing this image on your profile page for a looong time. ;-P', '2008-03-28 10:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
