(4594144, 661489, 33400, '<td valign="top">Oh, the fluffy yellow carnage!<br/> <br/>Really well shot - nice job.</td>', 'Oh, the fluffy yellow carnage! Really well shot - nice job.', '2008-03-28 16:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594158, 661230, 33400, '<td valign="top">There''s always been an undercurrent of prejudice between the bunnies and the chicks.  Who knew it could go this far?<br/> <br/>Good capture of the little guys in their natural environment...</td>', 'There''s always been an undercurrent of prejudice between the bunnies and the chicks.  Who knew it could go this far? Good capture of the little guys in their natural environment...', '2008-03-28 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594172, 661112, 33400, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  It''s so simple and dark even; yet it brings to mind questions that just seem to have no answers.<br/> <br/>Was this a malicious act?  Or was the killer perhaps color-blind and just didn''t see the little guy?<br/>Could this have been a hate crime by one of the many peep detractors out there?<br/>And what about the expression of surprise and even defiant anger on that little pink face?  Was there an ugly confrontation first?  Did the bunny lash out, only to discover too late that he was biting off more than he could chew?<br/>What does this say about a society that turns a blind eye to such things.  And what can we discern about the nature of wing-tips?<br/> <br/>So many questions - no answers... Alas, poor bunny, we knew him well!<br/> <br/>A striking and poignant capture!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  It''s so simple and dark even; yet it brings to mind questions that just seem to have no answers. Was this a malicious act?  Or was the killer perhaps color-blind and just didn''t see the little guy?Could this have been a hate crime by one of the many peep detractors out there?And what about the expression of surprise and even defiant anger on that little pink face?  Was there an ugly confrontation first?  Did the bunny lash out, only to discover too late that he was biting off more than he could chew?What does this say about a society that turns a blind eye to such things.  And what can we discern about the nature of wing-tips? So many questions - no answers... Alas, poor bunny, we knew him well! A striking and poignant capture!', '2008-03-28 17:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594178, 661295, 33400, '<td valign="top">Even I have not put pasties on a peep (yet).<br/> <br/>Really, when they get old, you should just eat them.  They should never stoop to this.<br/> <br/>(Clever shot, and well done..)</td>', 'Even I have not put pasties on a peep (yet). Really, when they get old, you should just eat them.  They should never stoop to this. (Clever shot, and well done..)', '2008-03-28 17:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
