(4597541, 661426, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great idea!  I just threw out my peeps but I wonder if stale ones would work this way?  I want some hot chocolate now...  Oh as for the photo, I like the contrast of brown tones and the golden peeps.  :)</td>', 'This looks like a great idea!  I just threw out my peeps but I wonder if stale ones would work this way?  I want some hot chocolate now...  Oh as for the photo, I like the contrast of brown tones and the golden peeps.  :)', '2008-03-30 21:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4597543, 661352, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  Great use of light and shadow to create an ominous feeling.  The part that cracks me up tho is the jelly bean picture.  I love all the little details you put into this picture.</td>', 'This is funny.  Great use of light and shadow to create an ominous feeling.  The part that cracks me up tho is the jelly bean picture.  I love all the little details you put into this picture.', '2008-03-30 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4597635, 661248, 85886, '<td valign="top">My favourite from the challenge - I really like the moody processing which really contributes to the fairy tale feel.</td>', 'My favourite from the challenge - I really like the moody processing which really contributes to the fairy tale feel.', '2008-03-30 23:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4597637, 661426, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great colours, lovely idea and executed very well.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Great colours, lovely idea and executed very well.  Hope this does well for you.', '2008-03-30 23:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4597639, 661066, 85886, '<td valign="top">Another of my faves - gave this a 9 for originality and humour, as well as great execution.  I love the expression on the rabbit...if you can possibly make a fluffy bunny look menacing, you have :)  I really want this to ribbon for you.</td>', 'Another of my faves - gave this a 9 for originality and humour, as well as great execution.  I love the expression on the rabbit...if you can possibly make a fluffy bunny look menacing, you have :)  I really want this to ribbon for you.', '2008-03-30 23:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4597640, 661166, 85886, '<td valign="top">Probably the coolest one of the lot imho.  Really stylish with great lighting, tone and composition.  Original and funny too.  Great job on the b&amp;w processing too.</td>', 'Probably the coolest one of the lot imho.  Really stylish with great lighting, tone and composition.  Original and funny too.  Great job on the b&w processing too.', '2008-03-30 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
