(4597952, 661184, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes, I know this was the BLUE ribbon winner..... Way to Go Aimee..... You are not alone as Tim got the RED as well in the MUG shot challenge..... What a pair and what wonderful and talanted photographers you both are.....</td>', 'Yes, I know this was the BLUE ribbon winner..... Way to Go Aimee..... You are not alone as Tim got the RED as well in the MUG shot challenge..... What a pair and what wonderful and talanted photographers you both are.....', '2008-03-31 02:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4597955, 661356, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top two.  Congrats on your top ten!  And yes, I''m one of those who was raised (raised, mind you!) on stale peeps.  Mom would buy them, open ''em up, and stick ''em in the cupboard for a month.  My sister tells me they''re "new and improved" and don''t get as stale now.  What are they thinking??  I shall recommend your method to her...  :-)</td>', 'This was one of my top two.  Congrats on your top ten!  And yes, I''m one of those who was raised (raised, mind you!) on stale peeps.  Mom would buy them, open ''em up, and stick ''em in the cupboard for a month.  My sister tells me they''re "new and improved" and don''t get as stale now.  What are they thinking??  I shall recommend your method to her...  :-)', '2008-03-31 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
