(4609015, 661442, 78255, '<td valign="top">That isn''t my hand in the shot, it''s my sisters. I guess if I wanted to get serious I could have set up the tripod and timer for a shot with me squishing the dang peep. ;) Thanks for the comments and GO PEEP HATERS! lol</td>', 'That isn''t my hand in the shot, it''s my sisters. I guess if I wanted to get serious I could have set up the tripod and timer for a shot with me squishing the dang peep. ;) Thanks for the comments and GO PEEP HATERS! lol', '2008-04-02 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4609451, 661487, 66253, '<td valign="top">I threaded the sugary beasts onto white thread, then attached several strings of them to a stick (sort of like for controlling marionettes). I think they might look more, er, natural if the threads were tied together and anchored to the ground, rather than being on parallel vertical strings.<br/> <br/>Of course I had to clone out the threads, which were surprisingly visible (I always thought white thread was supposed to be great for making things look like they were floating in the air). <br/> <br/>I staged <a href="//stresscafe.blogspot.com/2008/03/peeps-on-brain.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">a couple other shots</a> too.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R-c1Ii4FCsI/AAAAAAAAA3I/UZ5E1k-XBIg/s1600/peeps1.jpg'', strrpos(''//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R-c1Ii4FCsI/AAAAAAAAA3I/UZ5E1k-XBIg/s1600/peeps1.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//bp0.blogger.com/_2cHpQ_p0_Rw/R-c1Ii4FCsI/AAAAAAAAA3I/UZ5E1k-XBIg/s1600/peeps1.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-02 23:53:54.</i></td>', 'I threaded the sugary beasts onto white thread, then attached several strings of them to a stick (sort of like for controlling marionettes). I think they might look more, er, natural if the threads were tied together and anchored to the ground, rather than being on parallel vertical strings. Of course I had to clone out the threads, which were surprisingly visible (I always thought white thread was supposed to be great for making things look like they were floating in the air).  I staged a couple other shots too.', '2008-04-03 00:52:10.000000', '2008-04-03 00:53:54.000000', 0),
(4610280, 661425, 87808, '<td valign="top">they have better eyes than me, I can not see any cone marks.  Anyways, I thought cloning was legal in Advanced??<br/> <br/>Shame about the DQ, I thought this one was hilarous!</td>', 'they have better eyes than me, I can not see any cone marks.  Anyways, I thought cloning was legal in Advanced?? Shame about the DQ, I thought this one was hilarous!', '2008-04-03 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
