(4612088, 661425, 18799, '<td valign="top">There was a piece of a the tripod boom that the balloon was suspended from on the top.  There was a screw in the bottom plate that held the peep to the platform.   I stuck the thing out of a 6th story window.   It seems to me that what I cloned was no worse than a ton of other clone outs here, branches, telephone poles, tree lines etc.   Whatever.  <br/> <br/>I''ve requested my account be closed and my portfolio deleted.  Not because of this, this was just the final straw with issues I''ve got with some of the allowable activities on this site, mainly encouraged collaboration.  <br/> <br/>No sour grapes, time to leave.</td>', 'There was a piece of a the tripod boom that the balloon was suspended from on the top.  There was a screw in the bottom plate that held the peep to the platform.   I stuck the thing out of a 6th story window.   It seems to me that what I cloned was no worse than a ton of other clone outs here, branches, telephone poles, tree lines etc.   Whatever.   I''ve requested my account be closed and my portfolio deleted.  Not because of this, this was just the final straw with issues I''ve got with some of the allowable activities on this site, mainly encouraged collaboration.   No sour grapes, time to leave.', '2008-04-03 22:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4612204, 661425, 51793, '<td valign="top">Is there anyway you could post the original before you leave??? I do agree with you as far as not seeing the original. I know EXACTLY how you feel man. I was DQ''d for something similar. I think you should fight it and ask for a recount.<br/> <br/>This is why I wanted to change the rules, to make it completely clear for everyone that you can or can''t clone out certain items. If it was background you cloned out I think it should stay, but we would need to see an original to try and help.<br/> <br/>This is also why we should have other people auditing SCs decisions on DQs<br/></td>', 'Is there anyway you could post the original before you leave??? I do agree with you as far as not seeing the original. I know EXACTLY how you feel man. I was DQ''d for something similar. I think you should fight it and ask for a recount. This is why I wanted to change the rules, to make it completely clear for everyone that you can or can''t clone out certain items. If it was background you cloned out I think it should stay, but we would need to see an original to try and help. This is also why we should have other people auditing SCs decisions on DQs', '2008-04-03 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
