(4615144, 661295, 68035, '<td valign="top">...And then the punches flew<br/>And Peeps were bit in two....<br/> <br/>Oh my word lets brush over the fact that I know the words from Copacabana and talk about the shot<br/> <br/>Very funny, and I love the fact that you have managed to pose Lola so that she does look like a showgirl (possible who has seen better days).<br/> <br/>very nice colouring and I doo like the peep crowd in the background which is not so overpowering as to take away from the main image but which adds a lovely coloured back drop</td>', '...And then the punches flewAnd Peeps were bit in two.... Oh my word lets brush over the fact that I know the words from Copacabana and talk about the shot Very funny, and I love the fact that you have managed to pose Lola so that she does look like a showgirl (possible who has seen better days). very nice colouring and I doo like the peep crowd in the background which is not so overpowering as to take away from the main image but which adds a lovely coloured back drop', '2008-04-05 03:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4615163, 661356, 68035, '<td valign="top">Another of your very cool peg shots and an image that makes me both laugh and wince at the same time...the sharpness on the leading peeps ear squeezed under the peg is superb<br/> <br/>Congrats on another top ten and the great score</td>', 'Another of your very cool peg shots and an image that makes me both laugh and wince at the same time...the sharpness on the leading peeps ear squeezed under the peg is superb Congrats on another top ten and the great score', '2008-04-05 03:52:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4615181, 661383, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter welcome back to the fray!!!!<br/> <br/>I love the idea and the ''tear'' rolling down the face of the lead peep is wonderful and gives what is essentially a funny shot a touch of melancholy<br/> <br/>If I am being honest for my taste the lighting is a litte harsh but not terribly so<br/> <br/>Great leading diagonal as well</td>', 'Peter welcome back to the fray!!!! I love the idea and the ''tear'' rolling down the face of the lead peep is wonderful and gives what is essentially a funny shot a touch of melancholy If I am being honest for my taste the lighting is a litte harsh but not terribly so Great leading diagonal as well', '2008-04-05 04:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
