(4618608, 661506, 68035, '<td valign="top">Walter<br/> <br/>Good to see that you remain in touch with all things perverted peep!!<br/> <br/>The photo made me laugh at once and I knew of only one genius that could have taken it<br/> <br/>See all that effort we put into the sheep herders and all we needed to do was take flashing peeps to get our tops score!!<br/> <br/>Many congratulations on the placement and the fact that that shot is going to be with you for a long long time<br/> <br/>J</td>', 'Walter Good to see that you remain in touch with all things perverted peep!! The photo made me laugh at once and I knew of only one genius that could have taken it See all that effort we put into the sheep herders and all we needed to do was take flashing peeps to get our tops score!! Many congratulations on the placement and the fact that that shot is going to be with you for a long long time J', '2008-04-06 15:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
